11	 * its id assigned. Emits a single audit line on the dedicated {@code AUDIT} logger recording the new
12	 * owner's id, {@code customerCode} and {@code registrationDate} (ISO 'YYYY-MM-DD'). Read-only: it
13	 * inspects the stored owner without mutating it, then hands off to the responder.
